    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/c79613a24a27d13b55fb953c1e59562d.poster.avif?t=1748351092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/c79613a24a27d13b55fb953c1e59562d.webm?t=1748351092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/c79613a24a27d13b55fb953c1e59562d.mp4?t=1748351092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY</h2><i><strong><u>Shred zombies in slow-mo while drifting with your good old tractor?!</u></strong></i> Harvest crops, slaughter zombies, overcome epic boss fights and upgrade your vehicle. Rinse and repeat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Harvest crops<br></li><li>Kill zombies<br></li><li>Watch out for your fuel level. If you run out of fuel, you lose<br></li><li>Upgrade your vehicles<br></li><li>Engage unique boss fights<br></li><li>Fight your way through different seasons and weather conditions<br></li><li>Endless mode where you can kill thousands of zombies through endless waves and upgrade your vehicle on the go</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2>Your grandpa left his farm to you when he passed away, and you gave him the promise to keep the farm in good shape. After the zombie apocalypse, you take your good old tractor and protect your farm from zombies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HARVESTING</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/a21c359569aeb10c2cf0986cc31a55b7.poster.avif?t=1748351092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/a21c359569aeb10c2cf0986cc31a55b7.webm?t=1748351092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/a21c359569aeb10c2cf0986cc31a55b7.mp4?t=1748351092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Harvest your crops to earn coins<br></li><li>Different crops provide different amounts of coin.<br></li><li>Prevent zombies from damaging your crops.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TONS OF UPGRADES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/42c58dc185806f1b406bd3ae04f7708f.poster.avif?t=1748351092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/42c58dc185806f1b406bd3ae04f7708f.webm?t=1748351092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/42c58dc185806f1b406bd3ae04f7708f.mp4?t=1748351092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Use your coins to upgrade your vehicles</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Faster vehicles<br></li><li>Sharper turns<br></li><li>Better drifts<br></li><li>Bigger harvesters<br></li><li>Tons of guns including mortars, flamethrowers, and homing missile launchers!<br></li><li>and many more!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERYONE HAS A DIFFERENT TASTE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/66fdead735478d7db21b6bf778114a1d.poster.avif?t=1748351092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/66fdead735478d7db21b6bf778114a1d.webm?t=1748351092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/66fdead735478d7db21b6bf778114a1d.mp4?t=1748351092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hit, shred, or shoot the zombies. It's all up to you, all that matters is to kill those damn zombies and protect your precious crops! As a bonus to protecting your crops, enjoy the satisfying ragdoll zombies flying around when you hit them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EPIC BOSS FIGHTS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/a8e50d30b5d1f8649e82a53c90d7f5d5.poster.avif?t=1748351092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/a8e50d30b5d1f8649e82a53c90d7f5d5.webm?t=1748351092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/a8e50d30b5d1f8649e82a53c90d7f5d5.mp4?t=1748351092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Oh boy, she's really mad at you!</i> Engage unique boss fights and bring all you <i>gut</i> to take them down!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHOULD YOU BUY?</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/b6964b2590f214a5e10aecd3a2b0064f.poster.avif?t=1748351092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/b6964b2590f214a5e10aecd3a2b0064f.webm?t=1748351092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376720/extras/b6964b2590f214a5e10aecd3a2b0064f.mp4?t=1748351092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>How many of the following 10 suit you?</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Short, fast-paced action game<br></li><li> Drive various vehicles and drift around with them<br></li><li> Shoot and kill massive amounts of zombies<br></li><li> Satisfying gore death effects like limbs, blood flying around<br></li><li> Ragdoll zombies<br></li><li> Various vehicle upgrades<br></li><li> Little storytelling, much gameplay<br></li><li> Funny boss abilities like the pregnant boss throwing her babies at you<br></li><li> Dark humor<br></li><li> <i>Disinfect</i> zombies with your flamethrower</li></ul><br><br><strong>8-10 points:</strong><br>You are gonna love this game.<br><br><strong>5-7 points:</strong><br>I can still confidently suggest this game. You can focus on the things you like most. There is an endless mode where you can skip the harvesting, focus on the <i>meaty part</i> and kill thousands of zombies through endless waves and upgrade your vehicle on the go. You'll have a pretty good time.<br><br><strong>3-4 points:</strong><br>Maybe wait for a discount if you want to try it out.<br><br><strong>If you like 0-2 points:</strong><br>Sorry, this game is not for you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THANK YOU!</h2>If you decide to purchase a copy, thank you, I hope that you'll enjoy it.",
